<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibheri muchiKoreKore</book>
  <para style="h">VaThesaronika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raPhauro ku2 vaThesaronika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 VaThesaronika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 VaThe</para>
  <para style="mt1">2VATHESARONIKA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba rochipiri raPhauro</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsamba rochipiri kuvaThesaronika ridonyohwa noNhumwa Phauro (2vaThesaronika 1:1). Adonyora tsamba rakareri nguwa ipfupi kubva paadonyora 1 vaThesaronika, pamakore anenge makumi mashano noribodzi mumasure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu. Phauro wanga achiri kuKorinde paadonyora tsamba rakareri kukherekhe yokuThesaronika, inova kherekhe yaadomisikidza panguwa yohwendo hwache hwochipiri hwokoparidza (Mabasa 17:1-10). Zvinotauhwa mubhuku raMabasa kuti kherekhe yopaThesaronika yaiva novaJudha uye novatendi voyamwe marudzi vadowanda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kherekhe yepaThesaronika inofanira kunge yaiva neshungu pamusoro pezvonguva yokupedzisira uye nozvokuuya kwechipiri kwaKhirisitu, ndava Phauro adonyora zvizinji pamusoro pozvakarezvi mumatsamba yache yese kuvaThesaronika. Chikamu chinenge chopakati chotsamba yochipiri kuvaThesaronika chidonyohwa zvonguwa yokupedzisira. Phauro anopasa yambiro pamusoro povanhu vanondogara pasinai zvavanoita. Munhu wese anofanira kushanda kuti azviwanire zvokuja (vaThesaronika 3:6-10).</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anothanga tsamba nokuzviwidzira uye nokuwidzira chikwata chache pana (vaThesaronika 1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Zvino anodzotenda Mwari pamusoro pokherekhe yoThesaronika uye achivanamatira (2vaThesaronika 1:3-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Muchitsauko chochipiri Phauro anotaura pamusoro ponguwa yokupedzisira.</para>
  <para style="io1">Zvino anodzotaura pamusoro pokuti munhu areke kundogara, asi ashande (2vaThesaronika 3:1-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anopedzisa nokumoresa kherekhe pakare (2vaThesaronika 3:16-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Phauro, Sirivhanasi naTimoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">kuKherekhe yokuThesaronika iri muna Mwari Baba wedu naIshe Jesu Khirisitu:<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Mutsa norunyararo zvinobva kuna Mwari Baba naIshe Jesu Khirisitu mbazvive kwamuri.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutongewa Panouya Khirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Hama, tinofanira kutenda Mwari nguwa dzese nokuda kwenyu, sezvazvidokodzera, ndava kutenda kwenyu kuri kunyanya kukura, norudo pakati penyu ruri kuingidzika. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ndosaka isisu pachedu tichizvirumbidza pamusaka penyu kukherekhe dzaMwari nokuda kwokutsungirira futi nokutenda kwenyu pakutambudziwa kwese nokuedzewa kwamuri kuchiirira makuri.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ihwohwu ndihwo upfakazi hwokutonga kwaMwari kudorurama, kuti muitiwe vadokodzera kuva voumambo hwaMwari, hwamuri kutamburira. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Mwari adorurama, achatsiva avo vanokutambudzai, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />nokupasa rugare kwamuri vari kutambudziwa pabodzi naisisu, izvi zvichaitika panodzoonesewa Ishe Jesu pachena achibva kudenga pabodzi nongirozi dzache dzinomasimba yadonyanya, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />achatsiidza achiranga zvinodzimba vaye vasinai kuziva Mwari novaye vasinai kuteerera vhangeri raIshe wedu Jesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Vachatambudzika pakurangiwa kwokuparadziwa kusingapere nopakuvharihwa kunze kubva pamberi paIshe nopakubhwinya kwosimba rache, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />paachauya zuva rakarero kuti apasiwe kubhwinya muvatsvene vache, nokukanukiwa pakati povese vadotenda, ndava kupfakaza kwedu kwamuri kudotendewa.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Nokuda kwozvakarezvi tinoramba tichikunamatirai, kuti Mwari wedu akuitei vadokodzera kudaidza kwache, futi kuti nosimba rache azazise chido chenyu chokuita zvidonaka nobasa rokutenda, <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />kuti zita raIshe wedu Jesu rikudziwe mamuri, naimimi muri maari, zvichienderana nomutsa waMwari wedu naIshe Jesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Munyangadzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Hama dzangu tiri kukukumbiritsai, pamusoro pokuuya kwaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu nokuungana kwedu kuti tisangane naye, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />kuti mureke kukurumidza kugwetedzeka mupfungwa kana kushamisika, pangave pamusaka pomweya kana poshoko, kana potsamba ringanzi rinobva kwatiri, richiti zuva raIshe rauya. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Mbakureke kuva noanokufurirai nonzira dzomabhwodo, ndava zuva rakarero rinouyaba, kusvikira kupandukira kwathanga kuitika, nomunhu anochora mutemo waonesewa pachenu, iye adotemehwa kuparadziwa, <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />anoshora nokuzvitutumadza pamusoro pozvese zvinoitiwa mwari kana zvinonamatiwa, zvokuti anotoisa mupando wache muimba yaMwari, achizviti ndiye Mwari.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Hamuchayeuka chere kuti pandanga ndichinaimimi imimi ndidokunyepai zvakarezvi? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Futi munoziva chiri kumutadzisa ipopa kuti areke kuoneka pachenu panguwa yache. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Nokuti chidohwanda chokuramba kuchengeta mutemo chatova pabasa, kundoti anorambidza achambondorambidza basi kusvikira wadzobiritsiwa panzira. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Futi ipopo munhu asinai mutemo achabiritsiwa pachenu, iye achabaiwa naIshe Jesu nokufema kwomuromo wache nokumuparadza nokuoneka kwache uye nokuuya kwache. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Kuuya kwoasinai mutemo zvichiitiwa naSathani kuchava nosimba rese rino zviratidzo nozvishamiso zvomabwodo, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />nokufurira kwese kudonyangara kunovese vokuparadziwa, ndava vadoramba kuda chokwadi kuti vaponesewe. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Nondava yakareyo Mwari anovatumira kufuririka kudokungudza, kunovaita kuti vetende mabhwodo. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Kuti vese vasinai kutenda chokwadi asi vadofarira zvisinai kururama vapasiwe mhosva.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mudosarudzihwa Ruponiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Manje hama dzinodiwa muna Ishe tinosukumidziwa kumbondotenda Mwari nopamusaka penyu, ndava Mwari adokusarudzai kubva pakuthanga kuti muponesewe, kuburikidza nokunatsiwa noMweya nokutenda chokwadi. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Adokudaidzai kuno zvakarezvi kuburikidza novhangeri redu, kuti muve nokubhwinya kwaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Saka manje, hama mirai mudosimba, muchengetedze tsika dzatidokufundisai, kungave kufundisiwa noshoko, kana notsamba redu.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Kuburikidza nomutsa Ishe wedu Jesu Khirisitu pachake, naMwari Baba wedu, adotida ndokutipasa kunyaradziwa kusingapere notariro idonaka, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />mbaakurudzire mwoyo yenyu nokuimisikidza muzviito zvese zvidonaka nomushoko.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Tinamatirei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Hama pakupedzisira, tinamatireiwo, kuti shoko raIshe rikurumidze kupararira futi riremekedzewe, fanike zvaridoita pakati penyu, <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />kuti tihwihwe kubva kuvanhu vadoipa novanyangadzi, ndava havasi vese vanokutenda.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Asi Ishe adotendeka, achakusimbisai, nokukuchengetedzai kubva kuno adoipa. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Futi tinovimba kuti muna Ishe, kuti muri kuita futi muchaita zvinhu zvatinokurairai.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Futi dai Ishe watungamira mwoyo yenyu kurudo raMwari, nomukutsungirira kwaKhirisitu.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinangwa Chokushanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Hama zvino tinokurairai, muzita raIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu, kuti muzviparadzanise kubva kuhama yese inogara ichiita zvonungo zvinopesana notsika dzamudotambira kubva kwatiri. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Ndava vakaremi munoziva kuti munofanira kutiteedzera tini; tanga tisinai kundogara patanga tina imimi, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />hatinai kuphonyedza munhu tichija tisingamubhadhare, asi mukutambura tidoita basa tichishanda masikati nousiku, kuti tirekere kuva nomunhu watinochokwesa pakati penyu. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />hazvireve kuti hatinai kufanihwa nokodzero yakareyo, asi kuti mukujidzana kwedu tikupasei muenzaniso wokuteedzera. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Ndava nopatanga tinaimimi, tidokurairai zvakarezvi, “Kana pano asingadi kushanda, mbaareke kuja.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Ndava tiri kunzva kuti vamwe venyu vadondogara, vanondopambara, vasingaite basa. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Manje tinoraira vanhu vakarevo nokuvakurudzira muna Ishe Jesu Khirisitu kuti vaite basa ravo vadonyarara vachizviwanira zvinovachidza.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Asi hama, regai kuva nomakhato pakuita zvidonaka. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Kana mumwe munhu akaramba kuteerera zvatiri kunyaira mutsamba rakarei, ongororai munhu wakareyo, kuti murege kufambidzana naye, kuti anyare. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Regai kumutora fanike muvengi, asi murairei sehama.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mazvi Yokupedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Zvino Ishe worunyararo pachake mbaakupasei runyararo nguwa dzese nomutoo wese. Ishe mbaave naimimi mese.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Inipano, Phauro, ndanyora nojanja rangu ndichikumoresai. Kwakareku ndiko kuzikana kwomatsamba yangu yese. Ndiyo manyorero yangu.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Mutsa waIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu mbauve naimimi mese.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>